  "scope": "The responsibility, authoring-authority, independent-verification, and feedback relations for one rvw-review-compose producer handoff at commit f9416d9. Physical file ownership belongs to the companion file map; the reviewer's verification order belongs to the companion Walkthrough. Operation-specific CLI preflight, transport, publication, update, delete, and installer internals are excluded for direct code reading.",
